        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86697, Industrial Chic Haydon Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Industrial Modern Haydon Cabinet Knob is available in 2 sizes and 6 modern finishes. The Haydon Knob is sleek and stylish--a wonderful choice for kitchen remodels. Cabinet knobs like the Haydon can be used on any lightweight drawer or door. It comes packaged with the installation hardware.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Emtek Haydon Cabinet Knob:\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86697-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354682\" width=\"311\" height=\"127\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" atl=\"Emtek 86698 specifications\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86698-specifications.pdf?v=1704262414\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek Haydon Cabinet Knob Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>86697: Small</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86698: Large</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
